package soul.human-os

artifact kernel {
    title "The Kernel: Where the War Happens"
    includes [soul.human-os.kernel.ruh, soul.human-os.kernel.qalb, soul.human-os.kernel.aql, soul.human-os.kernel.nafs]
    body {
        Above the immutable core sits the **processing stack**, the layers that actually run your life. 
        These can be corrupted. These are the battlefield.
    }
}
